  "title": "Tiered Reasoning Escalation CFAA Logit Gate - Verified Output Manifest",
  "description": "Draft 2020-12 validation contract for the deterministic output manifest emitted by proofs/verify_tiered_reasoning_escalation_cfaa_gate.py against SPEC-TIERED-REASONING-ESCALATION-AND-CFAA-LOGIT-GATE-v1.0. Encodes the CFAA attestation (Invariant 21), TRE topology OpEx, the logit-margin binary-entropy escalation gate, the DPP homomorphic anonymization packet contract, and proof-carrying cache amortization. Unlicense.",
